            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">
              Fully Insured Team & Materials
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">
              Fully insured team carrying boarding materials, plus advice on next-step repairs.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

